# Objective :
Display failed logon attempts against disabled accounts , why ?
If logon attempts appear against disabled accounts, it may indicate that someone is trying to use old or stolen credentials.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1-) Event ID Used : 4625 # Failed Logon Attempt #
2-) SubStatus Used : 0xC0000072 # The account is disabled #
3-) KQL Filter : event.code:4625 AND winlog.event_data.SubStatus:0xC0000072
4-) Fields Used in the Table :
user.name.keyword => Username
host.hostname.keyword => The machine where the logon attempt occurred
winlog.logon.type.keyword => Logon type 
Count of records => Number of failed logon attempts
